52,2,4,talk,Minako,,"@Asuka, nine of ten is strong, but the credit line still ignores subscriptions. I need to know if this model protects our reserves before I commit.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Mio,,"@Asuka, nine out of ten is amazing! That means stable teams and no frantic hiring. I’m fully on board with the clinic scheduler!","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Toshio,,"@Asuka, nine of ten confirms the product sticks. No hardware, no external delays. The clinic scheduler fits my criteria perfectly.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
